  "_comment": "Item answers to enemy traits. A rule fires when at least min_heroes enemy heroes have the trait (src/d2bg/knowledge/traits.py). Item keys are checked against items.json and against items bought in pro matches on the current patch (tests/d2bg/test_knowledge.py).",
